{"message":"Let’s start with the network settings. Please set your phone’s network mode preference to 4G/5G preferred by running:

set_network_mode_preference(mode="4g_5g_preferred")

Let me know once that’s done, and we’ll move on to the next step."}

{"message":"Great! Next, please disable Wi-Fi Calling on your device by running:

toggle_wifi_calling()

Let me know once you’ve done that, and we’ll proceed to the next step."}

{"message":"Thank you. Now please grant the messaging app permission to send SMS by running:

grant_app_permission(app_name="messaging", permission="sms")

Let me know once that’s complete, and we’ll continue."}

{"message":"Great! Next, please toggle your mobile data by running:

toggle_data()

Let me know once you’ve done that and we’ll move on to the next step."}
